Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.42,0:22:41.38,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(200,320)}One day the light of love burning in your eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.38,0:22:43.30,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(0,320)}will transcend time
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.30,0:22:47.37,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(0,320)}and destroy one of this world's dreams
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.37,0:22:51.01,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(0,320)}as it spirals toward the apocalypse
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.01,0:22:53.86,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(0,320)}What is it that you seek
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.86,0:22:57.43,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(0,320)}now that you're done hesitating?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.43,0:23:02.49,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(0,320)}Is there a glimpse of hope for tomorrow
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.49,0:23:06.93,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(0,620)}beyond this greedy admiration?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.05,0:23:12.14,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(200,320)}I want to be armed with the power
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.14,0:23:15.95,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(0,320)}to shatter even the darkness in my hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.95,0:23:19.79,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(0,320)}just like the ancient magic in my childhood dreams,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.79,0:23:23.67,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(0,320)}the next time I see your innocent smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.67,0:23:27.46,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(0,320)}In my trembling hands I hold
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.46,0:23:31.29,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(0,320)}the courage of a plucked flower
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.29,0:23:35.13,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(0,320)}My feelings are all I can rely on;
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.13,0:23:39.00,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(0,320)}the prayer that awakens
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.00,0:23:46.70,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(0,1620)}the light
Dialogue: 5,0:00:19.62,0:00:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, are you here to see Kamijou{**-kun}?
Dialogue: 5,0:00:23.78,0:00:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:26.01,0:00:31.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but his examination schedule was \Nmoved up, so he's in Physical Therapy right now.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:31.59,0:00:34.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see... Thank you.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:37.72,0:00:40.57,Default,,0,0,0,,She sure visits a lot, doesn't she?
Dialogue: 5,0:00:40.57,0:00:43.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad she does. That patient \Nis in a difficult mental condition.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:43.85,0:00:46.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope she's cheering him up.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:47.40,0:00:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,He was a violin prodigy\N before the accident, right?
Dialogue: 5,0:00:51.79,0:00:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if he were able to walk again,
Dialogue: 5,0:00:55.14,0:00:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,he'll never be able to play an\Ninstrument for the rest of his life.
Dialogue: 5,0:01:03.94,0:01:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Why did it have to be Kyousuke?
Dialogue: 5,0:01:09.01,0:01:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}My fingers work perfectly,\N but what good are they?
Dialogue: 5,0:01:15.48,0:01:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Why couldn't it have been\N me instead of Kyousuke?
Dialogue: 5,0:01:21.40,0:01:25.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If I used my wish to heal his body,
Dialogue: 5,0:01:25.63,0:01:27.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}what would he think about that?
Dialogue: 5,0:01:29.08,0:01:32.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Would he just thank me? Nothing more?
Dialogue: 5,0:01:32.09,0:01:35.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Maybe I just want him to say something else.
Dialogue: 5,0:01:38.37,0:01:42.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm such a horrible person.
Dialogue: 5,0:01:43.47,0:01:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Now that I think about it, \NI was absolutely clueless back then.
Dialogue: 5,0:01:48.99,0:01:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I didn't know what it meant to pray for a miracle, nor the price of one.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.01,0:01:54.05,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,{OP}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.98,0:03:24.02,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,{Episode}
Dialogue: 5,0:03:28.79,0:03:29.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that a mole?
Dialogue: 5,0:03:29.71,0:03:30.43,Default,,0,0,0,,There, got it.
Dialogue: 5,0:03:44.70,0:03:45.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Madoka?
Dialogue: 5,0:03:45.49,0:03:46.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 5,0:03:46.37,0:03:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't hurry up and eat,\N you'll be late to school.
Dialogue: 5,0:03:49.00,0:03:50.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah.
Dialogue: 5,0:04:01.87,0:04:03.63,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, {*}Sis{*Nee-chan}?
Dialogue: 5,0:04:03.63,0:04:05.49,Default,,0,0,0,,D-Does it taste bad?
Dialogue: 5,0:04:06.59,0:04:09.17,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's good.
Dialogue: 5,0:04:09.58,0:04:11.39,Default,,0,0,0,,It's really good.
Dialogue: 5,0:04:11.39,0:04:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad's cooking tastes so good because I'm alive...
Dialogue: 5,0:04:18.04,0:04:23.47,Default,,0,0,0,,So I kept telling Yuuka,\N but she just didn't get it!
Dialogue: 5,0:04:23.47,0:04:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,She was almost crying, like, "Huh? What? \NDid I say something weird again?"
Dialogue: 5,0:04:28.74,0:04:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I was trying so hard not to laugh.
Dialogue: 5,0:04:32.04,0:04:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sayaka{**-chan}, about yesterday...
Dialogue: 5,0:04:34.86,0:04:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sorry, can we talk about it later?
Dialogue: 5,0:04:38.28,0:04:40.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Totally weird, right?
Dialogue: 5,0:04:40.35,0:04:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's kind of...
Dialogue: 5,0:04:44.36,0:04:47.93,Default,,0,0,0,,While a woman's prime age for childbirth
Dialogue: 5,0:04:47.93,0:04:50.31,Default,,0,0,0,,is based on medical fact,
Dialogue: 5,0:04:50.31,0:04:55.24,Default,,0,0,0,,using this to determine whether she's of marriageable age is a huge mistake.
Dialogue: 5,0:04:55.24,0:05:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Meaning that women over thirty clearly still \Nhave the chance for a loving marriage.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:01.88,0:05:05.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Therefore, you shouldn't be\N using the past perfect here,
Dialogue: 5,0:05:05.59,0:05:08.32,Default,,0,0,0,,but rather the present progressive tense—
Dialogue: 5,0:05:20.65,0:05:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like we're in a different\N world or something.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:26.09,0:05:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though nothing about the school or\N Hitomi{**-chan} has changed since yesterday,
Dialogue: 5,0:05:31.30,0:05:35.43,Default,,0,0,0,,now I feel like I'm surrounded by strangers.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:35.76,0:05:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,That's because no one knows.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:39.19,0:05:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We're the only ones who know about the witches and Mami{**-san}.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:42.16,0:05:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody else does.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:46.16,0:05:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like we're living in an entirely different world from them.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:51.70,0:05:53.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Sayaka{**-chan}...
Dialogue: 5,0:05:53.95,0:05:56.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Our world had changed long ago.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:56.83,0:06:00.83,Default,,0,0,0,,We should've realized that sooner.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:03.35,0:06:04.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What about you, Madoka?
Dialogue: 5,0:06:04.87,0:06:08.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you still want to\N become a magical girl?
Dialogue: 5,0:06:15.62,0:06:17.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 5,0:06:18.67,0:06:20.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't blame you for that.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:20.77,0:06:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I know it's not fair...
Dialogue: 5,0:06:23.67,0:06:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I know I'm just being selfish right now,
Dialogue: 5,0:06:26.48,0:06:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,but... I just can't...
Dialogue: 5,0:06:29.52,0:06:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Just remembering how she died... \Nmakes it hard to breathe.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:35.74,0:06:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so scared.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:37.44,0:06:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate this.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:43.38,0:06:47.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Mami{**-san} was really kind.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:48.59,0:06:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,To show us what it takes to fight, she...
Dialogue: 5,0:06:58.64,0:07:02.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Kyubey, what's going\N to happen to this city?
Dialogue: 5,0:07:02.81,0:07:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Who will protect everyone from the witches now that Mami{**-san}'s gone?
Dialogue: 5,0:07:09.16,0:07:11.89,Default,,0,0,0,,This has been Mami's\N territory for a while now,
Dialogue: 5,0:07:11.89,0:07:15.57,Default,,0,0,0,,but once the other magical girls find out, \Nthey won't stay back for long.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:15.57,0:07:18.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It won't be long before one of them arrives to hunt witches.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:18.79,0:07:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,But all they care about is finding Grief Seeds, \Nright? Just like that transfer student.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:25.29,0:07:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It's true that Mami was a rare breed.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:28.74,0:07:31.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Most people would\N think about personal gain.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:31.51,0:07:33.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody wants to be \Nrewarded for their actions.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:33.51,0:07:34.51,Default,,0,0,0,,So that means—
Dialogue: 5,0:07:34.51,0:07:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,But I think only other magical \Ngirls have the right to criticize that.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:46.11,0:07:48.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand how you two feel.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:48.31,0:07:51.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It's unfortunate, but I\N can't pressure you into it.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:52.41,0:07:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess this is it.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:53.66,0:07:58.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to go search for girls\N who need my contract.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:59.40,0:08:01.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Kyubey.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:01.43,0:08:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I'm sorry for getting you involved.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:05.54,0:08:10.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It was short, but thank you,\N Madoka. It was fun.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:19.85,0:08:20.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:57.32,0:09:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I'm so weak...
Dialogue: 5,0:09:01.92,0:09:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry...
Dialogue: 5,0:09:15.07,0:09:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Homura{**-chan}...
Dialogue: 5,0:09:23.44,0:09:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You're blaming yourself too \Nmuch for this, Kaname Madoka.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:27.30,0:09:27.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 5,0:09:28.54,0:09:32.21,Default,,0,0,0,,No one can criticize\Nthe choices you've made.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:32.71,0:09:35.09,Default,,0,0,0,,And even if they did,\N I wouldn't allow it.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:37.46,0:09:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems you've taken\N my warning to heart.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:42.32,0:09:43.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:46.71,0:09:51.03,Default,,0,0,0,,If only I had listened to you sooner...
Dialogue: 5,0:09:51.03,0:09:54.59,Default,,0,0,0,,That still wouldn't have\N changed Tomoe Mami's fate.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:56.74,0:09:59.86,Default,,0,0,0,,But I was able to change yours.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:00.37,0:10:03.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad to have saved at least one life.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:07.06,0:10:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-You know, Homura{**-chan}...
Dialogue: 5,0:10:10.06,0:10:15.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You seem like a veteran, but in \Na different way from Mami{**-san}.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:15.03,0:10:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps. I won't deny it.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:20.76,0:10:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you seen a lot of\N people die like yesterday?
Dialogue: 5,0:10:26.18,0:10:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:29.29,0:10:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,How many?
Dialogue: 5,0:10:31.85,0:10:34.05,Default,,0,0,0,,So many that I've lost count.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:37.19,0:10:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if her room\N will stay like that forever.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:41.63,0:10:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomoe Mami had only distant relatives.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:46.48,0:10:50.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure it'll be a while before anyone reports her missing.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:50.65,0:10:54.25,Default,,0,0,0,,So no one will even know that she died?
Dialogue: 5,0:10:56.01,0:10:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That's just how it is.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:57.75,0:11:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,If someone dies in there, \Nthere is no corpse left behind.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:01.00,0:11:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,She'll be deemed forever\N missing in this world.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:05.73,0:11:09.23,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what happens to\N magical girls in the end.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:22.99,0:11:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That's horrible...
Dialogue: 5,0:11:28.24,0:11:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,She fought alone to protect everyone,\Nbut no one will even realize she's dead...
Dialogue: 5,0:11:35.24,0:11:38.17,Default,,0,0,0,,That's terrible.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:39.72,0:11:43.83,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the nature of the contract that grants us the power we hold.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:44.73,0:11:46.29,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't fight to protect people.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:47.54,0:11:50.89,Default,,0,0,0,,We fight for the sake of our own wishes.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:51.36,0:11:54.59,Default,,0,0,0,,If our deaths go unnoticed by others and we're ultimately forgotten by this world...
Dialogue: 5,0:11:55.46,0:11:57.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Then that's just how it is.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:59.23,0:12:00.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll remember.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:01.53,0:12:05.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never forget about Mami{**-san}.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:05.28,0:12:07.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Never!
Dialogue: 5,0:12:07.87,0:12:08.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:09.60,0:12:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomoe Mami's lucky to have\N someone who thinks that.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:13.87,0:12:15.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough to make me jealous.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:16.29,0:12:17.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You too, Homura{**-chan}!
Dialogue: 5,0:12:17.67,0:12:20.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never forget about you either!
Dialogue: 5,0:12:21.20,0:12:24.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never forget how\N you saved us yesterday!
Dialogue: 5,0:12:28.18,0:12:29.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Homura{**-chan}?
Dialogue: 5,0:12:30.91,0:12:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You're too kind.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:32.64,0:12:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 5,0:12:33.68,0:12:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't forget that kindness can sometimes bring forth an even greater sadness.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:04.28,0:13:06.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you listening to?
Dialogue: 5,0:13:06.71,0:13:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,The Girl with the Flaxen Hair.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:08.75,0:13:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, by Debussy, right?
Dialogue: 5,0:13:11.09,0:13:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a beautiful song.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:16.47,0:13:23.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I guess I don't strike people as the type who would listen to classical music.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:23.27,0:13:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,So sometimes people get really surprised when I can name a piece like that.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:27.74,0:13:30.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It's weird, but they seem to respect me more afterward.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:33.91,0:13:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It's only because you\N taught me all about it.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:36.64,0:13:43.07,Default,,0,0,0,,If not for you, I probably would never have had \Nthe chance to really appreciate this type of music.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:43.07,0:13:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sayaka...
Dialogue: 5,0:13:44.68,0:13:45.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 5,0:13:46.73,0:13:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 5,0:13:48.69,0:13:51.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you torturing me?
Dialogue: 5,0:13:56.01,0:13:59.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you still making me listen to music?
Dialogue: 5,0:13:59.97,0:14:01.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you trying to cause me more pain?
Dialogue: 5,0:14:03.29,0:14:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I just thought that you loved music, so...
Dialogue: 5,0:14:05.72,0:14:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to listen to anything anymore!
Dialogue: 5,0:14:07.75,0:14:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I just sit here listening\N to music I can't even play!
Dialogue: 5,0:14:11.71,0:14:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I just... I just...
Dialogue: 5,0:14:24.70,0:14:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,My fingers won't move.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:26.28,0:14:28.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't even feel pain anymore.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:29.27,0:14:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What use is a hand like this?
Dialogue: 5,0:14:31.02,0:14:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be okay.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:32.42,0:14:34.31,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll all work out.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:34.31,0:14:36.93,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't give up,\N I'm sure someday...
Dialogue: 5,0:14:36.93,0:14:39.69,Default,,0,0,0,,They {\i1}told{\i0} me to give up.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:42.09,0:14:44.48,Default,,0,0,0,,They said I had no chance\N of ever performing again.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:44.90,0:14:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,My doctor told me personally that \Ncurrent medical technology can't heal me.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:50.70,0:14:53.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never be able to use my hand again.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:53.57,0:14:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It'd take a miracle or some kind of magic, \Nand there's no such thing.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:56.95,0:14:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,There is.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:59.51,0:15:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Miracles and magic do exist.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:16.38,0:15:21.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I think we could be friends with Homura{**-chan} if we actually communicated.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:21.80,0:15:25.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I wonder why she ended up\N fighting with Mami{**-san}.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:25.27,0:15:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 5,0:15:26.58,0:15:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hitomi{**-chan}?
Dialogue: 5,0:15:28.40,0:15:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Hitomi{**-chan}!
Dialogue: 5,0:15:30.34,0:15:32.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you have practice today?
Dialogue: 5,0:15:36.22,0:15:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's the same as that woman's...
Dialogue: 5,0:15:39.20,0:15:40.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Hitomi{**-chan}!
Dialogue: 5,0:15:41.22,0:15:43.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Hitomi{**-chan}!
Dialogue: 5,0:15:44.56,0:15:47.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Kaname{**-san}. Good evening.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:47.99,0:15:50.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-What's wrong?
Dialogue: 5,0:15:50.19,0:15:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 5,0:15:52.64,0:15:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Where?
Dialogue: 5,0:15:55.26,0:15:58.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going somewhere far better than here.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:58.85,0:16:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hitomi{**-chan}...
Dialogue: 5,0:16:00.72,0:16:04.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yes. You simply must join me!
Dialogue: 5,0:16:04.43,0:16:07.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, that would be just wonderful!
Dialogue: 5,0:16:09.71,0:16:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What should I do?
Dialogue: 5,0:16:11.74,0:16:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Isn't this...
Dialogue: 5,0:16:27.54,0:16:30.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If only I could get a hold of Homura{**-chan}...
Dialogue: 5,0:16:30.39,0:16:33.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But I forgot to get her cell phone number!
Dialogue: 5,0:16:37.59,0:16:41.31,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right. I'm worthless.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:41.31,0:16:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't even keep\N this small factory running.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:46.82,0:16:52.56,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no place for me in \Nthis world anymore. Not now.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:03.27,0:17:04.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen up, Madoka.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:04.71,0:17:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't handle these things properly, \Nsomething terrible could happen.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:10.48,0:17:12.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Our entire family could end up dying.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:13.14,0:17:14.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Make sure you remember that.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:16.00,0:17:17.15,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 5,0:17:17.15,0:17:18.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't do that!
Dialogue: 5,0:17:20.85,0:17:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You mustn't interrupt them.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:22.39,0:17:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,They're performing a holy ritual.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:24.42,0:17:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's dangerous!
Dialogue: 5,0:17:26.80,0:17:29.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone here will die!
Dialogue: 5,0:17:29.65,0:17:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right! We are all going on a \Njourney to another wonderful world!
Dialogue: 5,0:17:35.13,0:17:38.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you understand just\N how wonderful that is?
Dialogue: 5,0:17:38.67,0:17:41.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Our living bodies are holding us back.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:42.02,0:17:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaname{**-san}, I'm sure\N you'll understand soon!
Dialogue: 5,0:17:52.38,0:17:53.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Let go!
Dialogue: 5,0:18:35.77,0:18:37.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-What should I do...
Dialogue: 5,0:18:37.33,0:18:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What should I do?!
Dialogue: 5,0:18:45.64,0:18:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,,N-No!
Dialogue: 5,0:18:47.14,0:18:48.39,Default,,0,0,0,,This can't be happening!
Dialogue: 5,0:18:53.31,0:18:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,No! Please!
Dialogue: 5,0:18:55.38,0:18:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone help me!
Dialogue: 5,0:19:30.90,0:19:33.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I wonder if this is a punishment of some sort.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:35.68,0:19:40.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm sure this happened because I'm weak... Because I'm a liar.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:42.37,0:19:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's why...
Dialogue: 5,0:19:44.69,0:19:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm being punished.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:05.92,0:20:06.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Sayaka{**-chan}?!
Dialogue: 5,0:20:22.70,0:20:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Go back to hell!
Dialogue: 5,0:20:41.51,0:20:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, sorry about that.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:43.42,0:20:45.93,Default,,0,0,0,,That was a close call, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 5,0:20:45.93,0:20:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Sayaka{**-chan}... Those clothes...
Dialogue: 5,0:20:49.53,0:20:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 5,0:20:51.59,0:20:55.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess you could say\N I had a change of heart.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:56.94,0:20:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be fine!
Dialogue: 5,0:20:59.10,0:21:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I did all right for my first\N time on the job, didn't I?
Dialogue: 5,0:21:01.94,0:21:03.57,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 5,0:21:08.93,0:21:10.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 5,0:21:12.18,0:21:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmph.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:13.04,0:21:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You're too late, Ms. Transfer Student.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:43.36,0:21:46.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't expect {\i1}you{\i0} to come.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:46.61,0:21:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard Mami kicked the bucket,
Dialogue: 5,0:21:50.12,0:21:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,so I came all the way out here.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:53.12,0:21:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,But what gives? This isn't what you told me.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:56.87,0:22:01.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but there's already a new magical girl in this area.
Dialogue: 5,0:22:01.39,0:22:03.63,Default,,0,0,0,,She just made a contract\N not too long ago, though.
Dialogue: 5,0:22:03.63,0:22:06.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell? That really pisses me off.
Dialogue: 5,0:22:07.04,0:22:14.43,Default,,0,0,0,,But, y'know, I don't think I want to\N give such a great area to some rookie.
Dialogue: 5,0:22:14.43,0:22:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you planning, Kyouko?
Dialogue: 5,0:22:17.02,0:22:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't it obvious?
Dialogue: 5,0:22:18.52,0:22:22.77,Default,,0,0,0,,All I have to do is... beat the crap...
Dialogue: 5,0:22:23.65,0:22:25.11,Default,,0,0,0,,out of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.03,0:22:26.07,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,{ED}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.00,0:23:56.04,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,{Preview}
Dialogue: 5,0:23:57.54,0:24:00.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an1}I guess I'm flying high!
Dialogue: 5,0:24:00.23,0:24:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an1}You can count on Magical Girl \NSayaka{**-chan} to protect Mitakihara City!
Dialogue: 5,0:24:07.99,0:24:10.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an1}I will never regret it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.10,0:02:32.73,Opening-Connect-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5\fad(0,480)}I'll walk upon this Earth,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.73,0:02:34.80,Opening-Connect-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5}and pierce this shadowy veil of unease,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.80,0:02:38.41,Opening-Connect-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5\fad(0,580)}as many times as necessary
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.56,0:02:59.86,Opening-Connect-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5\fad(0,580)}with these unwavering feelings
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.71,0:03:15.55,Opening-Connect-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5}the beautiful blue sky will always be waiting for me
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.30,0:01:57.72,Opening-Connect-English-blue,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5\fad(200,0)}I'll never forget the promises we exchanged
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.72,0:02:00.18,Opening-Connect-English-blue,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5}I still see it when I close my eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.18,0:02:01.82,Opening-Connect-English-blue,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5}I'll move forward as I cast off
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.82,0:02:05.68,Opening-Connect-English-blue,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5\fad(0,580)}this darkness engulfing me
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.96,0:02:21.79,Opening-Connect-English-dreams,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5\fad(200,480)}How long will it be before
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.79,0:02:28.10,Opening-Connect-English-dreams,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5\fad(0,480)}I see that lost future again?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.55,0:03:17.84,Opening-Connect-English-night,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5}So I won't be afraid
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.84,0:03:23.97,Opening-Connect-English-night,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5\fad(0,1020)}No matter what happens next, I won't give in
